<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">Malachi</book>
  <para style="h">Malachi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malachi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malachi</para>
  <para style="mt">Malachi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia in Malachi ii Israel mite tungah a son tu Topa ii a piak thupuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah, “No kong it tawntung hi,” ci hi. Ahihang amate in, “Bangbangin nong itna hong lak kana ni ziam?” ci in zo kik hi. Topa in, “Esau le Jacob te sia unau laipee ahihang Jacob le a suan a paalte ka it a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuaciang Esau le a suan a paalte ka ngaimaw hi. Esau ii mualtung ngam ka susia a, a leitang sia ngiate atu in ka nusiat hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esau suan le paal Edom te in, “Ka khuate hong suksiatsak hi, ahihang tua khuate ka sa kik tu uh hi,” a ci ciang Topa in, “Khua sa kik ma hen — ka nuaitham kik tu hi. Mipite in tuate tungah, ‘Siatna ngam’ le ‘Topa ii a tawntung a thin uukna ngam’ a ci tu hi,” ci in zo kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mite in hite a mittang uh taw mu tu a, tuaciang amate in, “Israel ngam puasia ngawngawn ah Topa thahat hi,” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in thiampite tungah, “Tapa khat in a pa thasia a, innteang khat in a topa zakta hi. Keima sia na pa ka hi a — banghangin hong patoai ngawl nu ziam? Keima sia na topa khi hi — banghang hong zakta ngawl nu ziam? Note in kei hong zawngsak napi, ‘Bangbangin hong zawngsak khu ziam?’ na ci lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangbang ziam cile hi bang hi — ka biaknatau tungah a man nei ngawl ante nong pia uh hi. Tua zawkciang note in, “Bangbangin hong zakta ngawl khu ziam, ci in nong dongh uh hi. Hong son tong — ka biaknatau na zawnsak vawtna, na thusim ngawlna taw nong zatak ngawlna uh kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A mittaw, a ciina, ahibuale a peangbai nganno taw sangaw biakpiakna nong nei uh ciang, tuabangte phamaw sa ngawl na hi uh ziam? Ngamukmangpa tungah tuabang ngannote pia ka sin vun. Note tungah ama lungkimin maipha hong pia tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in no thiampite awng, ei tungah Pathian hong dik natu in hong ngen ka sin vun. Ama in na thungetna hong zo ngawl tu a, tua in noma mawna hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Ka biaknatau tungah a kimang ngawl meite na hal ngawl natu in note khat in biakinn kongkhate khak le uh teh kong oai hi. No tungah ka lungkim ngawl a; kei kung nong paipui biakpiaknate kong saang buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leimong khat pan mong khat ah a om mihingte in kei hong patoai uh hi. Amate in mun theampo ah ngimnamtui hong hal a, tuaciang a saan thamman sangaw biakpiaknate hong pia hi. Amate theampo in kei hong patoai uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong note in keima biaknatau sia bangma man nei ngawlin na son uh ciang le tua biaknatau tungah na nialnamh ante na piak uh ciangin, keima hong simmaw na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noma in, ‘Hite bangza in cimtak huai ziam!’ ci in nong mukmen uh hi. Nong biakpiak natu in a kingu nganno ahibuale a peangbai, a nanghno khat nong paipui uh hi. Note tung pan tuabangte hong saang tu in hong um nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nganhon sung pan keima piak tu in hong kamciam a limci khat nei napi, a man nei ngawl nganno khat taw sangaw biakpiakna nei tu in hong theampa in haamsiatna thuak tahen! Banghang ziam cile keima kumpi lian khat ka hi a, ngam theampo pan mihingte in kei hong kiita uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in thiampite tungah, “Hi thupiakna sia note atu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na sep, na vawtna taw keima nong patoai uh kul tu hi. Kong ci bangin nong ngai bua uh le no tungah haamsiatna kong tungsak tu hi. Na kivaak natu a, na saan uh vanhte tungah haamsiatna ka tungsak tu hi. A tatakin ci leang, tuate tungah, haamsiatna tungsak zo khi hi, banghang ziam cile kong thupiakte no in na thupi sim bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tate daan ka pia tu a, na sangaw biakpiakna nganhingte ii eak sungah na mai kong taat tu hi — tuaciang note eak kholna munah hong kipaipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Levi suan le paal thiampite taw ka thuciamna a peal ngawl natu in hi thupiakna kong piak hunlam na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Amate ii hong thasia thei natu in ka thuciamna sungah ka kamciamsa nuntakna le nopsakna ka pia hi. Tua hunlai in amate in kei hong zakta a hong kiita uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a maante hil a, a maan ngawlte hil ngawl hi. Amate in kei taw hi vadiamin nungta uh a; amate mama in a maan teng a sep dom ngawlin midang tam mamate zongh siatna a vawt ngawl natu in hu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian a maan bang a heak takpi natu in hilna sia thiampite vaipuak ahi hi. Mite in amate kungah pai in ka deina a sin kul hi, banghang ziam cile amate sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii kamtaite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ahihang tu in no thiampite in lampi maan panin na pial zo uh hi. Na hilna in mihing tam mama khialsak hi. No taw ka vawt thuciam sia paltan zo nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note in ka deina nong ni bua uh a, ka mite na hil uh ciang zong, khat le khat doidan na hi uh ciang, Israel mite in note kong simmawsak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eite theampo in a kibang pa nei kana ngawl hi ziam? A kibang Pathian in eite theampo hong bitphua kana ngawl ziam? Tua ahile eite khat le khat, ih kamciamte banghangin paltan a, ih taanghpupite taw Pathian ii a vawt thuciam sia banghangin zawnsak vawt tu hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah mite in Pathian tungah a kamciamte paltan a Jerusalem le ngamsung bup ah a thasiathuai mama khat vawt uh hi. Amate in Pathian ii a it Biakinnpi sia ninsak uh hi. Pate in ngamdang pathiante a bia numeite teenpui zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kuama po hi bangin a ngamtate sia Topa in Israel taangpite sung pan heam tahen a, Vaanglianbelpa Topa tungah ih minamte ii a paipui biakpiakna sungah kihel kiksak nawn heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ngamtatna dang khat sia hi bang hi. Ama tungah na biakpiaknate hong saang nawn ngawl ahikom kap a tau in, Topa biaknatau sia na thitui taw na khuumsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghangin hong kisaang nawn ngawl ziam ci in na dongh uh hi. Tua thu in na khanmoi lai a na teenpui na zi tungah na kamciamna paltan zo na hi sia a heak hu ahi hi. Na zi sia na koppui hi a, ama tungah a thumaan pasal ka hi tu hi ci in Pathian mai ah kamciam pia napi na paltan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian in ama le nang pumkhat thinkhat tu in hong vawt hi kana ngawl ziam? Hi thu ah ama ii tupna bang ziam? Pathian mite tatak ahi tu in tate na nei natu ahi hi. Tua ahikom note kuama in a zi tungah a piak kamciam paltan peuma heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel ii Topa Pathian in, “Nupa kikhulna ngaimaw khi hi. Note khat po in a zi tungah tuabang a ngitlo ciang ngaimaw khi hi. Na zi tungah na thumaan tu a, na kamciam na paltan ngawl natu in kidawm in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na kampauna uh taw Topa toisak nu hi. Ahihang, “Ama bangbangin toisak khu ziam?” ci in dongh nu hi. “Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ngamtat siate theampo phasa hi; tuabangte diksa takpi hi,” ci nu hi. Tua ahibuale, “Thutangin ih heen Pathian sia koisungah om hi tu ziam?” ci in dongh nu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Ka lampi a sialkhol tu in ka kamtaipa ka paisak tu hi. Tua zawkciang na zon uh Topa zongh ama Biakinnpi sungah thakhat thu in hong pai tu hi. Mu tu kaal na ngalaak uh kamtaipa hong pai in, ka thuciamna thangsak tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang ama ii hong pai ni ciang, akua peuma in thuak zo tu hi ziam? Ama hong kilangh ciang akua nungta zo tu ziam? Ama in a pha satpia le thik a thiangsak meikuang taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in ngunn a thiangsak pa khat bangin thukhen tu in hong pai tu hi. Thik seakpa in khamh le ngunn a thiansak bangin a maan biakpiakna te Topa kungah hong paipui natu in, Topa kamtaipa in thiampite thiansua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Judah le Jerusalem mite ii paipui biakpiaknate in nidang hun bangma in Topa lungkimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Note thukhen tu in no kungah kong kilangh tu a, bum le ai toaite, palngul mawna vawtte, leilot tetti pangte, a naseamte ii thaman a demte, meingong tanga le ngamdangmite tung pan meet natu a zongte — kei hong zakta ngawlte theampo ii langkhat ah tetti ka pang tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Keima in Topa ka hi a, ka kikheal bua hi. Tuaciang no, Jacob suan le paalte zongh na mong siat bualai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note, na taanghpupi masate bangin ka thukhamte pan na puapial uh a, na zui bua uh hi. Kei kungah hong heak kik tavun, tua hile kei zongh no sang kong nga tu hi. Ahizong ‘Nang kung kong zot kik natu in bang ka sep uh kul tu ziam?’ ci in nong dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu khat hong dongh tong, mihing khat in Pathian a theam tu kilawm ziam? Kilawm mama ngawl hi, tua hi napi note in kei nong theam uh hi. ‘Bangbangin maw?’ ci nu hi. Sumpi sawm a khat le biakpiaknate sungah hong theam nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No theampo tungah haamsiatna khat hong tung hi, banghang ziam cile minam buppi in kei nong theam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungah an tam mama a om thei natu in sawm a khat a cingin hong paipui tavun. Kei hong sin tavun, vantung khelkite ka hong tu a, na pha namcinte kicing takin no tungah kong buaksuk na mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lungnote in na lo ante a lalsak buatu a, na sapitkungte sapitnga taw kidimsak tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang, na ngam na lei uh sia a teen nophuai mun le ngam pha suak tu ahikom minamte theampo in mi lungdamte hong ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Kei taw kisai in a lauhuai thute son nu hi. Ahizong note in, ‘Nang taw kisai bang teng son na khu ziam?’ ci nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in, ‘Pathian na ih sep sia a luithawthong hi. Ama ci bangin ih sep hangin bang kimanna om a, ih sepna sate huvau Vaanglianbelpa Topa mai ah khuangaina ih lak nop hangin bang phat tuamna om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ih mu bangma mihing kiphasak teng ma in a lungdam hi. Mi siate sia nuamsa bek ngawlin a ngamtat siatnate taw Pathian thin sauna ze et napi, bangma tat tuan ngawl hi,’ ” na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa a kiitate khat le khat kipaupui hi, tuaciang Topa in amate son teng ngai in za hi. Ama mai ma ah Topa a kiitate le a zaktate tepteena sia laibu khat sungah ki at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Amate ka mite hi tu hi. Ka dian ni tak ciang amate mama keima neisa hi tu hi. A pa atu a seam tapa tungah pa khat in hesuakna a nei bangin amate hesuak tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei atu a seamte le a seam ngawlte, tuaciang thutangte le a seksolte tungah a piang thute ii kilamdanna sia ka mite in khatvei mu kik tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “A kiphasakte theampo le misiate theampo taangphaw bangin a kak tu ni hong theng tu hi. Tua ni in amate kaanghtum tu a, amate taw kisai bangma a taang nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang kei thu hong ni note tungah kong ngupna vaangletna sia ni bangin hong suak tu a, nizangte bangin damna hong puak tu hi. Ngankhawk khat sung pan a kitha khuinote bangin suakta in lungdam tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka dian ni ciang, mi seksolte na zothal tu uh a, amate sia na peang nuai a leivuite bang hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Israel mite theampo zui tu in, Sinai Mual tungah ka naseampa Moses ka piak thukhamte le thupiaknate, tuaciang hilciannate ciamtee tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ahihang a lauhuai le a lian Topa ni hong thet ma in kamsaangpa Elijah kong paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in pate le tate hong ngawmtua kik tu hi; tuabang ahibuale keima kong pai tu a, na ngam ka suksiat kul tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
